note The Lapis command files, used. Lapis listed commands in commands.lp and
note charts.lp but no Lapis program ever called them; this one does.
note
note `use commands` makes the instructions that commands.shark shares visible
note here, so `show title` reads like a built-in instruction. Build and run:
note   python compose.py run examples/lapis/showcase.shark

use commands
use charts

keep visitors as 1250
keep goal as 2000

page Showcase
  show title Welcome to Shark
  show chart bar with visitors
  show progress visitors times 100 over goal
  show button Add a visitor
  show button Finish to page Done

  when Add a visitor is pressed
    set visitors to visitors plus 1

page Done
  show title Thanks for visiting
  show progress 100
